## Do NOT use (unless Chase explicitly asks)

| Wrong target | Why |
|--------------|-----|
| **App Dashboard** (`School Scrips/App Dashboard`) | Separate launcher app â€” not the Electron overlay grid |
| **Main toolbar strip** (`toolbar.html` `data-action="â€¦"` buttons) | Small dwell buttons (volume, scroll, ðŸ“š). Not where school app launchers go |
| **`launch_macro_app`-style toolbar shortcuts** | Direct strip buttons â€” only if Chase says "toolbar button" or "main toolbar" |

`apps.json` is metadata for paths only (via `school-launchers.js`). Adding an entry there **does not** put a tile in the Launcher Panel.

## Profile gotcha

`toolbar-profile-service.js` can hide launcher **tiles** on PC (`isLauncherEnabled`). New launchers Chase wants visible must not be added to `PC_FULL_MODE_HIDDEN_LAUNCHERS` without asking.

